# secrets.nu and history.txt must never be adopted or symlinked into this repo.
# They're gitignored ("don't track"), but gitignore only stops git, not
# `stow --adopt`, which pulled them in and replaced them with symlinks
# anyway. That's the exact failure mode that lost claude/.claude/projects to
# a single rm -rf: secrets.nu (real shell secrets) and history.txt (command
# history) were physically living only inside this git working tree.
^secrets\.nu$
^history\.txt$
